  "decision_needed": [
    {"question": "The nursing home (Park View) appears only in the all-fund budget-and-actual schedule (Nursing Home revenues 3,761,937; Public buildings - nursing home 3,760,166), not in the audited governmental or proprietary fund statements. Should it be counted as a business-type fund of the village or left out as a separate entity?", "amount": 3761937, "recorded_as": "detail only, fund Nursing Home, business-type, patient service revenue / hospital/health care (not in receipts, disbursements or business_type)", "source_page": 9}
  ],
  "notes": "Modified cash basis. Governmental receipts/disbursements from the Totals column of the governmental funds statement (p5); the roll-forward uses fund balance (544,662 to 402,864, p6) as cash. Net transfers (118) in the Totals column recorded as transfers_out 118; Loan to Nursing Home (46,000) recorded as other_financing. Taxes and Intergovernmental split using the General Fund combining schedule (p10) and statement of activities (p3); Street fund taxes 24,698 are franchise fees (Statement of Activities franchise fees 77,086 less General Fund 52,388); Street/Debt Service intergovernmental have no printed breakdown. Business-type: operating revenues 357,206 plus no nonoperating revenues; nonoperating (expenses) capital 47,387, principal 30,631, interest 13,582 treated as disbursements; total disbursements 350,797 printed on p2 (259,197 + 91,600). Business-type roll-forward 238,279 + 357,206 - 350,797 + 118 = 244,806. Balance sheet from government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1), total column; no liabilities printed. Detail: General Fund combining schedule (p10) used instead of the p9 combined budget schedule (all-fund types, includes nursing home) to avoid double counting, except the Nursing Home revenues 3,761,937 and Public buildings - nursing home 3,760,166 lines, which appear on no other schedule and are recorded from p9 as a business-type Nursing Home fund (no separate printed total); business-type detail covers operating lines only (nonoperating lines are in main disbursements). Governmental net position per p1 totals 402,864 matches fund balance. Community Building department spending is general government (p5 General government 110,684 = General 86,988 + Community Building 23,696). Read pages 1-10 of 10 Recheck: business-type operating expense lines split by fund column so the Ambulance fund (37,806) is public safety and Sewer/Water/Sanitation are utilities."
}